1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,690
ChatGPT will help you build

2
00:00:01,690 --> 00:00:03,340
a terrible business idea

3
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,850
and make you feel like a genius

4
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:05,960
the whole time.

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,590
That’s the dangerous part.

6
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:08,680
You ask it,

7
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,080
Was this a good idea?

8
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,510
Suddenly you got a business plan,

9
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:14,490
a logo, and a whole lot of

10
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:15,910
false confidence.

11
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,360
Try this instead:

12
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:20,140
Give me five reasons this business could fail.

13
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,160
Then tell me what evidence I need

14
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,770
before spending one dollar.

15
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:24,970
Now you’re not asking AI

16
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,100
to hype you up.

17
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,820
You’re asking it

18
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,650
to find your blind spots.

19
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,260
Because the most expensive thing

20
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,530
AI can give you

21
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:33,090
isn’t a bad answer.

22
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:35,580
It’s confidence in a bad idea.
